          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni nubwo yayesengeriize MUKAMA naagamba ati: “Ai bambi, MUKAMA Ruhanga, nkwesengeriize onyijuke, ompe amaani, nkwesengeriize omurundi gumu gwonka, Ai bambi Ruhanga, Abafirisiti obamporre enzigu, habw'amaiso gange abiri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni yahwangura enyomyo ibiri eza hagati ezikaba zikwasire enju, yaziigamira n'amaani, omukono gwe ogw'obulyo guhambiire emu, n'omukono gwe ogw'emoso guhambiire endi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagamba ati: “Onyikirize ntwarane n'Abafirisiti.” Nubwo yasindikire n'amaani ge goona, enju yagwera abalemi kandi yagwera abantu boona abakaba barumu. Abantu aba yaisire ha kufa kwe, baali baingi okukiraho aba akaba aisire omubwomeezi bwe bwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo bagenzi be neeka ye yoona baija baamutwara, baamuleeta baamuziika hagati y'ensi Zoora na Esitaholi, omukituuro kya Manoha ise. Obu akaba amazire emyaka amakumi abiri nayebembera Isirairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.31"
            ]
          }
        }
